<%= intro %>

<%= verify_note %>

<% if ds_present? -%>
<%= step("Turn DNSSEC off") %>

<%= outage_warning %>

1. Sign in at https://porkbun.com/account/domainsSpeedy and expand **<%= domain %>** (**Details**).
2. Beside **DNSSEC**, open the editor and delete every DS record. Change nothing else.
3. <%= confirm %>
4. <%= after_dnssec %>

<% end -%>
<%= step("Use Cloudflare's nameservers") %>

<%= ns_timing %>

1. Sign in at https://porkbun.com/account/domainsSpeedy and expand **<%= domain %>** (**Details**).
2. Beside **Authoritative Nameservers**, choose **Edit**.
3. Delete the Porkbun nameservers and enter exactly these two:
<%= ns_list %>
4. <%= confirm %> Then **Submit**.
5. <%= done %>
